  "findings": [
    "All12 contact pages inspected, covering all32 prediction and GT evaluation bundles. Seven full prediction cases and four fixed-middle full GT cases inspected.",
    "Painted lane lines and road align with the front RGB; eight cameras add rear/side coverage. Temporal differences are modest. Far line false positives and ragged road edges remain.",
    "Ego and front blind region remain unknown; current occluders create black wedges. Gray non-road observed regions do not imply free space.",
    "Cyan candidate is geometric lane center only. It can approach an observed bicycle/object; no clearance, obstacle avoidance or control authorization follows from it.",
